sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Causes table
    participant CC as Causes Controller
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Open causes page or apply filters
    UI->>CC: Request cause list
    CC->>CA: Select causes with name, description, TRS flag and active status
    CA-->>CC: Cause records
    CC-->>UI: Cause list
    UI-->>Admin: Display cause information

    alt No matching cause or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show empty table or error message
    end
